  "question": {
    "text": "Four identical particles of mass <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> are located at the corners of a square of side <math><mi>&#8216;</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>&#8217;</mi></math> . What should be their speed if each of them revolves under the influence of other&rsquo;s gravitational field in a circular orbit circumscribing the square?<br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0152_f3082be3c6b9.png\" />"
